{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/pulls/1651","id":5173033579,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQ8oa8s8AAAABNFY6aw","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/pull/1651","diff_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/pull/1651.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/pull/1651.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/issues/1651","number":1651,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[I17:E01] Board, Queue, Planning and Review Artifacts","user":{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Overview\n\nBoard, queue, planning and review artifacts expose their executing commands in numbered steps and their linked Inputs and Outputs in Fields, so each operation provides its own call contract. The conversion preserves accepted input shapes, runtime guards, command payloads and original Prerequisites. Six supplementary fresh-context walks are explicitly **Partial**: their read accounts and limits are published separately; no completed live workflow, formal measured overview or token-savings result is claimed.\n\n## Changes\n\nArtifact operations and their consuming test readers share the command and contract presentation used by the converted Work Planner families.\n\n### Artifact Operations\n\n- **Own executing commands.**\n  Operations carry raw HTML command blocks, resolving argument contracts and explicit retry inputs.\n- **Keep contracts focused.**\n  Fields defines accepted shapes once; executing steps retain runtime checks and real flag bindings.\n- **Preserve artifact ownership.**\n  Board Queue links Lane's task-lane reading, unit-lane checks and report labels while owning Ready Units and Report Lines.\n\n### Consuming Readers\n\n- **Read executing sections.**\n  Planning and checkout tests use shared heading and lexical spans, decode actual invocations and exclude literal payloads.\n- **Retain behavioral assertions.**\n  Original planning, checkout and acceptance checks remain, with actual-HTML, literal and nonvacuity controls.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n| Test | Description | Coverage | Pass |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| T1 | Literal-head strict Check Skill Files: 58 Markdown files, 15 converted artifacts, zero findings | AC6 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w06-board-queue-planning-and/validation.md#strict-style) |\n| T2 | Full actual Work Planner suite: 930 total, 929 pass and one opt-in skip | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w06-board-queue-planning-and/validation.md#work-planner-suite) |\n| T3 | Shared checker suite: 258 pass | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w06-board-queue-planning-and/validation.md#shared-suite) |\n| T4 | Command/literal bytes and ordering, original Prerequisites, input shapes and semantic preservation | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w06-board-queue-planning-and/validation.md#preservation) |\n\n## References\n\n- **R1.** [Planning record](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/tree/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w06-board-queue-planning-and) — exact source identities, preservation mappings, required checks and retained historical failures.\n- **R2.** [Supplementary disclosure observations](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w06-board-queue-planning-and/disclosure.md) — all six Partial walks, actual read accounts, archived results and unapplied bounded goal concerns.\n","created_at":"2026-11-05T14:16:30Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T14:16:30Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"aa1c005d6a90993af9d89d1fd957d78c191c6b61","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/pulls/1651/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/pulls/1651/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/issues/1651/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/statuses/86748050dc69b532a5ac144a5c1a93f2f25b96da","head":{"label":"m2ux:i17/e01/w06-board-queue-planning-and","ref":"i17/e01/w06-board-queue-planning-and","sha":"86748050dc69b532a5ac144a5c1a93f2f25b96da","user":{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.c